Brother Zeal is the Inquisitor who mans the night desk at the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Inquisition/index|Inquisition]]'s office. He is a human of about seven and a half feet, with taut skin and a shaved head, and he wears the same raiment as every other Inquisitor. The name Anais is carved into his forehead in the same pearlescent material the raiment is made of, and a third eye there moves on its own to keep watching whoever stands before him. The desk he sits behind is raised so that it looks down even on a visitor nine feet tall.
